# Lakeside Minuet (jeuno 95) at level 30 with ENABLE_WOTG 0 (a number: the check compares with 1): WotG alone fails
# check 1; no section; Laila's default 10120. Then ENABLE_WOTG 1.25 (a step): the Lua's 1.25 == 1 fails too (a
# rounded read would pass): the default 10120; then 1: check 1 holds: 10111.
lists UpperJeuno/Laila/onTrigger
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-52.5,0,101 job=WAR lvl=30
setting ENABLE_WOTG 0
login
trigger Laila                           # WotG off: no section; default 10120
finish
setting ENABLE_WOTG 1.25
trigger Laila                           # 1.25 is not 1: no section; default 10120
finish
setting ENABLE_WOTG 1
trigger Laila                           # WotG on, level 30: 10111
finish                                  # option 0: not begun
